# 2026-10-18 FIX — GitHub Pages (leeex1.github.io/Quillan-Ronin) was serving a
# raw Git-LFS pointer instead of the site: every visitor saw
# "version https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1 ..." because `*.html` was routed
# through LFS and Pages does not resolve LFS pointers when publishing.
# Introduced in af6cbb65 ("HF mirror", 11:24). HTML is text and must never be
# LFS-tracked. The negative attributes below both drop LFS for future adds and
# force text handling, so no CRLF mangling on checkout either.
*.html -filter -diff -merge text
*.obj filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
